      "title": "He, she and showing respect",
      "tip": { "title": "Three ways to say he or she", "body": "- **அவன்** 'he' and **அவ** 'she' (written அவள்) are for children, friends and people younger than you.\n- **அவரு** (written அவர்) is a respectful 'he/she'; **அவங்க** (written அவர்கள்) means 'they' and is also a very respectful 'she'.\n- The verb shows the level too: அவன் இருக்**கான்**, அவரு இருக்**காரு**, அவங்க இருக்**காங்க**.", "pattern": "அவன் / அவ  ·  அவரு  ·  அவங்க", "grammar": 0 },
